          %h3#universal_property Universal property
          %p
            Recall from the above that
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi Chu
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                  %mi C
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
